#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:152
#. Diagram label
msgid "Computable agreement?"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:165
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Computable only. A person checks that the ODRL says what the text says, and signs it off. A program can check the ODRL is well formed; it cannot check that it matches the text."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:159
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Computable only. One assigner and one assignee (ODRL 2.2 §2.1.3), permissions and prohibitions with target assets (§2.2), constraints (§2.5.1) and duties (§2.6.3), written as JSON-LD. Purposes from HL7 PurposeOfUse."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:231
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Compute SHA-256 (FIPS 180-4) of the signed text, and of the ODRL file if there is one, recorded as DCAT 3 spdx:checksum and verified by check:dsa-hash."
msgstr ""

