#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "One DCAT 3 record: the agreement as a catalogued resource, each file a dcat:Distribution with dcat:downloadURL and spdx:checksum; datasets it covers carry odrl:hasPolicy. Versions are linked with DCAT 3 versioning (previous version, version, current version)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/content/dsa-document-lifecycle.bpmn:117
